w Pump</h1>\n<p>Stainless steel screw pump JIADI manufactures Stainless steel screw pumps in many sizes, styles, configurations and materials specifically designed for the chemical processing industry, pollution control industry, marine applications and original equipment manufacturers and so on. 1. Product...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52504282\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271027112937785.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>Stainless steel screw pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271027146883074.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI manufactures Stainless steel screw pumps in many sizes, styles, configurations and materials specifically designed for the chemical processing industry, pollution control industry, marine applications and original equipment manufacturers and so on.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (Specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Model</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">EGDa</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">RPM</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">2850</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Body material</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Volts</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220/380 V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Insulation class</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Outlet</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">G 1&amp;rdquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Maximum Diameter</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">98 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">530-608mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Q Max</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">2.5 m³/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">H Max</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">130 m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Package</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Wooden box or Carton (with or without plastic foam)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">MOQ</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">50 pieces / sample order is available</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Power Source</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Submersible</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Yes</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271029288269494.jpg\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271031201237460.jpg\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Pure copper wire<br/>·The lifespan of the motor is longer <br/>·The temperature of the motor is lower</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Various Choices<br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271031328518680.jpg\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·You can choose the material for the outlet, Oil chamber and Suction chamber<br/>·Iron/ Stainless steel / Copper</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Bearing<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271031451499491.jpg\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Material: C&amp;U<br/>·Better balance and less noise</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Mechanical Seal<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271031592694750.jpg\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Material: Carborundum Graphite<br/>·Prevent the oil to be leaked</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box <strong>    </strong><br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271032106403210.jpg\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Control the operation of the pump<br/>·Fire-resistant material casing</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Cable<br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271032232142216.jpg\" title=\"image020(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Four cores cable with durable rubber protecting<br/>·Cable produced &amp; qualified by JIADI</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271033326265442.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image022(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI PUMP can be applied to many conditions like industry, farm irrigation, house drinking water, and municipal facility, garden and so on to remove the water from the deep bottom to the ground.</p><p><strong>5. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI Pump Industry is a comprehensive enterprise that integrates submersible pump R&amp;D, innovation, manufacturing, sales, technology support, design, installation, maintenance and Solar pump after-sales service. We have established a long-term and good cooperative relationship and sold our products to over 70 countries. To be a group, our business scope has covered many kinds of pumps, like centrifugal pump, submersible pump,</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271033362682610.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image024(001).jpg\"/></p><p>sewage pump, screw pump and so on. Also welcome custom-made and OEM service.  </p><p><strong>6. Our service</strong></p><p>All of the enquiry will be replied within 8 working hours</p><p>Professional pump producer, with design team.</p><p>All of the goods are packed with standard export wooden case(non-fumigation)</p><p>Fast delivery time: 20-30 days</p><p>Support OEM or ODM</p><p>Fast after-service</p><p><strong>7. Our Benefits</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271033451503682.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image026(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about warranty and after-service?</strong></p><p>A: 12 months warranty time after receiving days, not including quick-wear parts and default phase. We promise 24 hours action for your problem. And send parts by air or express for your fix.</p><p><strong>2. Q: How to deliver my order?</strong></p><p>A: Small orders will be choose by express, by airline. Large orders will be choose by sea. It will depend on customer’s request.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Could you provide samples?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, of course. We will send samples to you against advance deposit, but you should afford to pay the price of sample pump and the freight charge.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: stainless steel screw pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-well-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch